domain:spec#3 · os-support-ai · session_01WGufzgbJhFoXYsLSe5WSPP

A ready patch for both items exists in the project's shared files, at `seat3-orders/28283-s1-s2-fix.patch`. It was written by the #27687 dev and is one commit against `service-datasource`:
- the collision owner is claimed only on a successful connect;
- the unset-variable sentence becomes a "(note: …)" after the driver's error;
- two new pins, each ablated red.

The package-wide checks and the gates were not run on it, so whoever takes this card reruns them. Apply it after #28208 merges.
